When you #chat with a monster/shopkeeper/etc., you are essentially
saying "What's up?"  They then respond appropriately.  If you're
standing on an object in a shop, the shopkeeper will tell you the
price.  Otherwise, he'll just complain about shoplifters (unless it's
Izchak).  Temple priests always ask for donations to their temple. 
Hobbits seem to be oddly obsessed over rings :)

